"slug": "lilipalace", "storyline": "There is a place that appears like a mirage. Disappearing and reappearing over and over again. In this place, people have been disappearing. Seria, a knight of the kingdom, has come to this place to investigate the rumors of villagers suddenly disappearing. However, that place was a labyrinth where starved demons run rampant...\n\nWithin the dungeon, there are many monsters and traps. A woman wearing a white tunic, adventurers, a suspicious man wearing a hood, the disappearing villagers... Are they friends or enemies?\n\nWill Seria be able to solve the mystery of this place and escape...?", "summary": "Women have been disappearing into a mysterious labyrinth... Play as the half-elf knight Seria and uncover the truth in this Dark Fantasy RPG.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/lilipalace", "videos": [{"id": 195203, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "lf6vOekGggo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lf6vOekGggo", "title": "Lilipalace - Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lf6vOekGggo/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}